<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">RIPRAG: Hack a Black-box Retrieval-Augmented Generation Question-Answering System with Reinforcement Learning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
